{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号白字和红色强调词「不再藏着喜欢」「我不再为它道歉」，位置靠上、字号大、颜色对比强，最先吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定。能看到他不再隐藏对对方的喜欢，但他具体处于什么关系和处境，第一眼还不能确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"坦然、不再羞于承认喜欢，带有释然和欣喜。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他意识到自己需要对方，即使对方不需要自己也愿意陪伴；以及担心两人以后未必还能亲近，欢喜中夹杂心痛。这些信息需要读长句并结合其他文字才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：上方红色块、中间黄色块、下方灰色块都很突出。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起来才懂：不再隐藏喜欢、接受自己的在乎、担忧未来关系，需要结合阅读。\",\n    \"单块较长，一块里有好几层意思，不能只靠扫到强调词就完整理解处境。\",\n    \"放大的词本身能传递情绪，但不能独立说明人物具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4cd07859-1c4e-4a59-9db6-84ab65a36dc0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T012240742957Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:23:00.921883+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "df07e198f68e40eba811bd47676319b7fcec2bc31d95a438dc511c2825406eb0", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessio